      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"108795\">@tinyait</user-mention>.</p><p>Since both the gauge and analog clock widgets use a texture mapper to display the needle, have you ensured that the texture mapper format in use is enabled under Config → Framework Features?</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/275bc77d-7c7b-4aad-b0b0-98dfab4428ff.png\"/></figure><p>Best regards,<br/>Johan</p></div>"
